# --- Generated converter output at the repo root ---
# The CLI writes <name>.md, <name>.artifacts.json and <name>_assets/ next to the
# output path. Ignore all generated output; keep only the project docs.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/README.ja.md
!/CLAUDE.md
/*.artifacts.json
/*_assets/

# Local test input PDFs (papers) are not part of the repository.
/*.pdf
